{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hiori.smile",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "君のことを教えてほしい",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hiori.smile",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hiori.smile",
    "idolId": "hiori",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "制作人……？怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，不……倒也不是出了什么事。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "只是一直没找到和灯织好好说话的机会，想留一点这样的时间。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "说话，是吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。为了今后的制作，我想了解灯织。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以，能让我先问几个问题吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "可以，没问题……答案会改变制作的方针吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不能说完全没有，但希望你能轻松地回答。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……我明白了。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那么……先说说兴趣之类？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "兴趣……大概是听音乐吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "休息日会做什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "做饭，或者反复练习自己不擅长的舞步……大概是这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "还有……学校生活怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……抱歉，能停一下吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？怎么了，灯织？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "我不觉得这些对偶像活动有帮助。希望问更有建设性的问题。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是、是啊，抱歉……",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……不。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "是我这边才对，抱歉……我说得有点过了。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，没关系。你肯把真实想法说出来，我很高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "诶……？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今后要一直一起走下去，坦白最要紧！",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "这样……吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……没想到您会那样理解我的话。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我们是搭档。作为交换，我也直接问一句，可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "好，请。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "灯织想成为什么样的偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "我想成为……闪耀的偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "闪耀的偶像啊……原来如此。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "很抽象吧……抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没有这种事。我觉得这是很了不起的目标。",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……谢谢。还有其他问题吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不用了，重要的事已经听到了，足够了。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "这样啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……制作人。再说一次，今后请多关照。",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。一起加油吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "47"
      },
      "47": {
        "id": "47",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哦，快到时间了……喂，灯织！等等我！",
        "nextNodeId": "48"
      },
      "48": {
        "id": "48",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "来，快走吧，制作人。"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "马上就到面试会场了。",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……是的，确实。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我说，能不能走慢一点？",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "为什么呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这样下去，会到得相当早。",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "hiori",
        "text": "确实是这样……但我想早点到，先做热身。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这、这样啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
